aper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6426c5c1ddf8ad0013ac0b69/SA106_Notes_2023_Cymraeg.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Use the SA106 supplementary pages when filing your SA100 Tax Return to:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>declare foreign income and gains</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>claim foreign tax credit relief</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"related-forms-and-guidance\">Related forms and guidance</h2>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/limit-on-income-tax-reliefs-hs204-self-assessment-helpsheet\">HS204: Limit on Income Tax reliefs</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/overlap-relief-hs260-self-assessment-helpsheet\">HS260: Overlap</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/foreign-tax-credit-relief-capital-gains-hs261-self-assessment-helpsheet\">HS261: Foreign Tax Credit Relief: Capital Gains</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/income-and-benefits-from-transfers-of-assets-abroad-and-income-from-non-resident-trusts-hs262-self-assessment-helpsheet\">HS262: Income and benefits from transfers of assets abroad and income from Non-Resident Trusts</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/calculating-foreign-tax-credit-relief-on-income-hs263-self-assessment-helpsheet\">HS263: Calculating foreign tax credit relief on income</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/remittance-basis-hs264-self-assessment-helpsheet\">HS264: Remittance basis</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/gains-on-foreign-life-insurance-policies-hs321-self-assessment-helpsheet\">HS321: Gains on Foreign Life Insurance Policies</a></p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"The Self Assessment (foreign) form and notes for the tax year 2025 to 2026 have been added and the 2021 to 2022 versions have been removed.","public_timestamp":"2026-04-05T23:15:18Z"},{"note":"The Self Assessment (foreign) form and notes for the tax year 2024 to 2025 have been added.","public_timestamp":"2025-04-05T23:15:14Z"},{"note":"The Self Assessment (foreign) form and notes for the tax year 2023 to 2024 have been added.","public_timestamp":"2024-04-05T23:15:17Z"},{"note":"The form and notes have been added for tax year 2022 to 2023, and the 2019 versions have been removed.","public_timestamp":"2023-04-05T23:15:22Z"},{"note":"The SA106 form and notes have been updated for tax year 2021 to 2022. Versions of the form from 2018 have been removed.","public_timestamp":"2022-04-05T23:15:13Z"},{"note":"The Foreign (SA106) form and notes have been added for tax year 2020 to 2021.","public_timestamp":"2021-04-05T23:30:02Z"},{"note":"The Foreign (SA106) form and notes have been added for tax year 2019 to 2020.","public_timestamp":"2020-04-05T23:30:03Z"},{"note":"The Foreign (SA106) form and notes have been added for tax year 2018 to 2019.","public_timestamp":"2019-04-05T23:15:06Z"},{"note":"The form and notes have been added for tax year 2017 to 2018.","public_timestamp":"2018-04-05T23:45:19Z"},{"note":"The form and notes have been added for tax year 2016 to 2017.","public_timestamp":"2017-04-05T23:45:16Z"},{"note":"Rates, allowances and duties have been updated for the tax year 2016 to 2017.","public_timestamp":"2016-04-05T23:30:15Z"},{"note":"The 2015 to 2016 form has been added to this page.","public_timestamp":"2015-04-05T23:30:35Z"},{"note":"Added translation","public_timestamp":"2014-04-22T23:00:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Form","documents":["<section data-module=\"ga4-link-tracker\" class=\"gem-c-attachment govuk-!-margin-bottom-6\">\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail govuk-!-display-none-print\">\n    <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-ga4-link=\"{&quot;event_name&quot;:&quot;file_download&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;attachment&quot;}\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69bbd5d34b1db2e4ba9b645f/